{"name": "Axom: Conquest", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Axom: Conquest</strong> is a hold-out style Tower Defence Roguelite for strategy fans who love breaking games with overpowered builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build an impenetrable fortress, unlock bowling towers, nukes and a tiny robot named Jeff. Defend from thousands of relentless physics-driven alien swarms and unlock powerful meta-progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Difficulties to conquer + Endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"4\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1781979281\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/fbb6ea240b825b4b71afd0c6fe3f83b7.webp?t=1781979281\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/35499a5e37a2e53568475c8622226a0c.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/35499a5e37a2e53568475c8622226a0c.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/35499a5e37a2e53568475c8622226a0c.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a sprawling fortress -</strong> Protect your Nexus Drill against the endless swarms of <i>Centurax</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your economy</strong> <strong>-</strong> Expand outwards and extract Axom's resources with refineries and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b2210c46bfd3e11497ff3cbd7617235c.webp?t=1781979281\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/0845bd94ce2820bddfbe632ce90aff0f.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/0845bd94ce2820bddfbe632ce90aff0f.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/0845bd94ce2820bddfbe632ce90aff0f.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Run is Truly Unique</strong> \u2013 Interlocking systems, procedural maps, branching towers, upgrade chains, alien upgrades, unique enemies and game changing consumables make no run the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of Starting Classes</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Pick a Nexus variant before each run, each with unique stats and abilities that steer your strategy to your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Alien Infection</strong> - Balance offence and defence as the planet itself rejects your presence. Infected tiles grow gradually forcing constant adaptation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/dbea984f8b3fdb99bdb2f188708003c3.webp?t=1781979281\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/6ed6e4dc8719dba0ed902dfe80fea21f.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/6ed6e4dc8719dba0ed902dfe80fea21f.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/6ed6e4dc8719dba0ed902dfe80fea21f.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not just Towers - </strong>Mix towers, traps, and robot armies into the mix of your arsenal of tools to conquer.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Structure Variants - </strong>Alternate versions of structures that are super powered. Double barrels? Nuclear ammo?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/11a91167d3b58456a5d144f3f87e9f6b.webp?t=1781979281\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3e519584e1a45720519a95242047626c.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3e519584e1a45720519a95242047626c.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3e519584e1a45720519a95242047626c.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a huge research tree packed with upgrades, unlocks, and new options, allowing you to add variety and take on more challenging threats\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't forget to Wishlist and Follow to keep up to date with the game!</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Build and defend your fortress while expanding out in this hold-out tower defense roguelite. Battle across a procedural alien homeworld, fight back corrupted terrain, discover hundreds of structures and upgrades as physics-driven swarms threaten to wipe out humanity.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/42d866f58d33416697a92883f6b2acc97771adbe/header.jpg?t=1781979281", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Roguelike", "Strategy", "Base Building", "RTS", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Hairy Penguin", "publishers": "Hairy Penguin", "release_date": "Jun 9, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "2143600", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-2B3-Nf0CiU", "first_seen": 1780956000.0, "review_rank": 455}